  "prefLabel": "Env-A 1405.03 Obtaining a Permit",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 1405.03 Obtaining a Permit. Except as provided in Env-A 1405.04, the owner or operator of a process or device at a stationary source subject to this chapter, that requires a permit pursuant to Env-A 1405.01 shall obtain such a permit in accordance with Env-A 603.\n\nSource. #13334, eff 2-3-22",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-a1400.html"
